gate: CLOSED
v:4 c:$ m:navitrack-config role:dev x:architect
task: S06 TQ — Post-sprint code quality review + refactor
sprint: S06
requires: [FRONTEND_DEV, ARCHITECT, CODEMAP_QUALITY_ADVISOR, BUN]
test_mandate: ../intel/TEST-COVERAGE-MANDATE.md
quality_mandate: ../intel/CODE-QUALITY-MANDATE.md

context: |
  REQUIRED closeout for every sprint. Review this sprint's diff for:
  - Shared UI reuse (src/ui) — extract duplicates
  - React best practices (composition, hooks, lean re-renders, file size)
  - Tauri best practices (thin native, capabilities, adapters)
  - Design-system consistency with mobile-apps tokens
  Refactor in this task when needed. Do not start next sprint with unpaid smells.
  Optional: CODEMAP_QUALITY_ADVISOR structural verdict.

out:
  - refactors under paths.code as needed
  - optional note: sprints/S06/QUALITY-NOTES.md

cmd:
  - bun run test
  - bun run lint

done:
  - Quality review completed per CODE-QUALITY-MANDATE.md
  - Needed refactors applied (or explicit follow-up .pd opened same day)
  - Shared UI / React / Tauri checklist satisfied
  - `bun run test` passes after any refactors
